Z||000008||Oreif||06-23-2001||01:02 AM||||FieroKyle, It works Great!! The system has been working for a month now but I just finished the cover earlier this week.<P>Fierofrek, If you look inside at the bottom of the side panel there is a grill. This leads up to the sailpanel window. the vent of the sail window draws air out. The bottom of the panel is open. (Hot air rises cold air sinks) Natural cooling flow. No fan needed for the amps I'm running.||||reg||1
